    {
      "id": "20261011-07-disposition-zone-title-0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 198,
      "width": 2340,
      "height": 32,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "A. 完整审批与控制快照（后端规划） → B. Controller 原子执行（已实现）",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:22:53.958Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:22:53.958Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-07-disposition-zone-1",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 970,
      "width": 2380,
      "height": 380,
      "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa",
      "strokeColor": "#ced4da",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:22:53.958Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:22:53.958Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-07-disposition-zone-title-1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 988,
      "width": 2340,
      "height": 32,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "C. 成功只代表保管位置迁移；风险/负债/审批仍须持续管理",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:22:53.958Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:22:53.958Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-07-disposition-case",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 250,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 210,
      "backgroundColor": "#f3e8ff",
      "strokeColor": "#9c36b5",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "1 / 案件处置提案（规划）\n固定 caseId / source / token / amount\n明确全部相关 HOLD 的批准范围\n核定义务分配、reserveToMove 与证据\n默认目的地为同租户 Quarantine"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:22:53.958Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:22:53.958Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-07-disposition-snapshot",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 650,
      "y": 250,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 210,
      "backgroundColor": "#f3e8ff",
      "strokeColor": "#9c36b5",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "2 / 读取控制快照（规划）\nsource/destination controlDigest\n全局/资产 epoch、count、holdDigest\nsecurityPaused 与 totalReserve\n本案 reserveVersion / routeEpoch"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:22:53.958Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:22:53.958Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-07-disposition-approve",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 250,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 210,
      "backgroundColor": "#f3e8ff",
      "strokeColor": "#9c36b5",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "3 / 独立 Council ERC-1271\n签 DispositionPermit 精确参数\npreserveRestriction = true\nClearing 登记资产另绑定 lotsHash\n新增案件/控制变动使旧快照失效"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:22:53.958Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:22:53.958Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-07-disposition-submit",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1830,
      "y": 250,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 210,
      "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee",
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "4 / Relayer → executeDisposition\nonlyExecutor + nonReentrant\n资产/租户/金额/时间/证据校验\nverifyCouncil + 双边 controlDigest\n目标池类型和 Disposition 路由校验"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:22:53.958Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:22:53.958Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-07-disposition-consume",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1830,
      "y": 610,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 210,
      "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee",
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "5 / 一次性 operationId\n校验源为预测 Vault 或登记池\n消费 operationId；同步搬预留\n禁止源/目标 SECURITY_PAUSED\n不能拿普通 Permit 替代处置签名"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:22:53.958Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:22:53.958Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-07-disposition-reserve",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 610,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 210,
      "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee",
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "6 / relocateReserve 原子预留\nsource 本案 reserve -= reserveToMove\nreserveToMove ≤ amount 且 ≤本案预留\ndestination 本案 reserve += 全部 amount\n在 Quarantine 增加本案 HOLD"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:22:53.958Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:22:53.958Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-07-disposition-source",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 650,
      "y": 610,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 210,
      "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee",
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "7 / 源资产的受限准备\n未部署 Vault：Factory 原子部署\nClearing lot：绑定集合并扣释放量\n无 lot：amount ≤ balance - outstanding\n其他源不允许携带 lot 参数"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:22:53.958Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:22:53.958Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-07-disposition-move",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 610,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 210,
      "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee",
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "8 / source.dispose 精确转账\n只有固定 Controller 可调用\n源余额仍覆盖其他/剩余预留\nTreasury 另保留 safetyFloor\n任一失败使标记/lot/预留/转账全回滚"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:22:53.958Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:22:53.958Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-07-disposition-receipt",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 1050,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 210,
      "backgroundColor": "#f3e8ff",
      "strokeColor": "#9c36b5",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "9 / 最终链 DispositionExecuted\n核对 caseId / source / destination\namount / preserveRestriction\noperationStatus = Executed\n校验预留和 lot 的最终变更"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:22:53.958Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:22:53.958Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-07-disposition-ledger",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 650,
      "y": 1050,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 210,
      "backgroundColor": "#e3fafc",
      "strokeColor": "#0c8599",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "10 / PG 事务（规划）\n资产位置迁移与 lot 镜像\nreserve allocation / movement links\n风险义务和用户受限负债仍存在\n最终 disposition + 审计 + Outbox"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:22:53.958Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:22:53.958Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-07-disposition-retain",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 1050,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 210,
      "backgroundColor": "#fff0f0",
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "11 / Quarantine 受限保管\n无普通外部付款入口\n全部新转入金额均有 reserve + HOLD\n源池其他案件控制不自动解除\n隔离不证明整个源池已干净"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:22:53.958Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:22:53.958Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-07-disposition-release",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1830,
      "y": 1050,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 210,
      "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee",
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "12 / 受控释放 Quarantine\n所有源/目标 HOLD 均已批准解除\n重新签完整快照，preserve=false\n仅回登记 Treasury 并释放相应预留\n最终外付仍走 Treasury 提现协议"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:22:53.958Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:22:53.958Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-07-disposition-note0",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 1450,
      "width": 1120,
      "height": 300,
      "backgroundColor": "#fff0f0",
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "完整批准的边界\n合约核对 Council 签名和当前控制快照相等，不能解释链下证据或法律结论。\nCouncil 必须审阅快照包含的全部有效案件；一个 caseId 不等于批准其他限制。\n控制变化使旧签名失效；HOLD 可按批准例外迁移，但 SECURITY_PAUSED 永不在该入口绕过。\n源案件之外的 reserve 留在源池；转入 Quarantine 为全部 amount 加 reserve。"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:22:53.958Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:22:53.958Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-07-disposition-note1",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1260,
      "y": 1450,
      "width": 1120,
      "height": 300,
      "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa",
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "Clearing 的两个分支\n登记 lot：lotsHash = keccak256(abi.encode(lotIds, amounts))；总量必须等于 permit.amount。\nprepareDisposition 允许未成熟 lot，但原子退休释放量，后续不能重复 settle。\n未知直入款：lotsHash=0 且两数组为空，仅使用 balance-outstanding 超额部分。\n未知资产并不因为收到而变成白名单资产；当前实现不提供任意资产 rescue。"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:22:53.958Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:22:53.958Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-07-disposition-note2",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 1830,
      "width": 2320,
      "height": 220,
      "backgroundColor": "#e7f5ff",
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "后端接口边界（规划）：受限内部 disposition command 固定 controlId、payloadHash、caseId、expectedVersion 和批准证据。\n同键同载荷重试，同键不同载荷拒绝；链调用在短 PG 事务之外，desired 和 observed 分别持久化。\n公网租户不直接提交 Controller calldata，不获得 Council 签名；风险控制回执只披露可授权信息。\nQuarantine 回 Treasury 仅为资产内部移动，不自动恢复用户可用、不自动退款。"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:22:53.958Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:22:53.958Z",
      "version": 1
    },
